{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_07_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_07","title":"何以忘卻","storyCode":"IS-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"37f38fdf8d656dcd4dd55697744381bf30e7a8888baeeb8a0bfdde5bfaf6e8b7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"食品安全部部長推薦自己接任建設部部長。企鵝物流幾人終於在敘拉古相見，但還有更重要的事等待她們解決。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最不起眼的食品安全部......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人緣但不被重視的食品安全部部長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，卡拉奇這樣，為了各大家族之間的平衡而被推選出來的人已經不再需要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您需要一個安全而又好用的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧部長，真正安全而又好用的傀儡，從來不會這麼自稱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是比其他人多一些自知之明而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好一個自知之明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧，如你所說，你確實是替代卡拉奇的最好人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然你如此坦誠，那我也不妨告訴你一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡拉奇，是我的人殺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很有勇氣，我不討厭和你這樣的人聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我可以給你一個機會，盧比奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走出這間房間，忘記你剛才說過的話，這樣的話，你不會受到任何傷害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，回去和你的妻子還有女兒團聚，好好享受這座城市最後的一點安寧時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣，您難道不是更加需要一個我這樣的傀儡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要的，正是眼下的混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想要推翻西西里夫人定下的秩序，然而，西西里夫人治下也好，更早的時期也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家族之間的鬥爭，從來與普通人無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當一切發生時，我們只能等待一個結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這個角度來說，是西西里夫人統領這個國家，還是您統領這個國家，對我們普通人來說毫無分別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，最後的勝利者，卻總是需要一個統領表面秩序的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您作為一個家族的領袖，想必是明白這個道理的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普通人離開家族並非無法生存，但家族離開普通人，卻未必如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想說，你們才是強者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是一些弱者的自圓其說罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一個自圓其說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這不能解釋你真正的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"權力，尊敬的貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小就因為這副長相和孱弱的體格，被身邊的人看不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，來自身邊的人的壓迫，比來自家族的還要直接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一路隱忍到現在，就是為了等這一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您說是您殺了卡拉奇，我只覺得，我這一次來對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說句您不愛聽的，您想對抗西西里夫人，我覺得，您很難獲勝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這又有什麼關係呢，我不在乎您到最後能不能贏——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這份權力，西西里夫人給不了我，只有您能給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很誠實，盧比奧，我喜歡和誠實的人交朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領......（耳語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳下命令，就說，今天到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝洛內家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的房間......好像震了一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，她選擇了你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這股震動，是喬萬娜的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們決裂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，德克薩斯從窗戶跳出去了，我們快跟上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，德克薩斯，如果，我是說如果，當年我們成了朋友，是不是，我就能把你留在敘拉古呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，不可能吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只會互相廝殺至死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐，不要逼我......殺了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的任務要完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭小姐，下輩子，希望你不要出生在敘拉古。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洗車工","speakerId":"avg_npc_693_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......薩盧佐家族的殺手吧？這場行動......已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝納爾多先生在剛才已經下令了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭，你不該出現在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你妨礙了薩盧佐家族的行動，這會破壞我們兩個家族之間的關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，不妨用我的頭顱去向阿爾貝托請罪，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等，貝納爾多先生......不，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個不情之請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必萊昂圖索少爺接下來也會十分繁忙，要他像之前協助卡拉奇那樣協助我，恐怕是不現實的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正想要向您要一個新的助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐顯然是一個十分合適的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也確實是個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，瞧我，拉維妮婭小姐，把您晾在一邊擅自就把話題進行下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛才，貝納爾多閣下決定，由鄙人，前食品安全部部長盧比奧，接替卡拉奇的位置，成為下一任的建設部部長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我必須誠實地說，我在政府相關事務方面並沒有足夠的經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_689_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我希望富有經驗的您，來成為我的助手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道空她們的狀況如何......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼，你......您會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人老了，總是想找個地方享享清福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！她在那！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"包圍她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，您是不打算讓路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為當年的事，她還是頗為擔心你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢，年紀大了，如今愛做的，也不過是關照一下年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下陪我這個老頭子聊聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......下次一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i18"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可頌？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，讓我瞧瞧，是誰在這裡孤軍奮戰啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼你們都來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根據我的觀察，敘拉古家族的企業文化應該是——打群架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我們企鵝物流的企業文化則是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"派對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個場合，應該是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從不怕群架，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"完全正確！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，老爺爺，看在我們是同族的分上，不能放我們一馬嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說蠢話了，能天使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一定的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，敘拉古的雨季也確實漫長了些，年輕的時候沒有感覺，如今，關節炎也是個煩惱啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人們，爭強好勝不是壞事，但也要注意身體健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，不是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，如果我想和您聊天的話，該去哪裡找您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你尋找救贖，那我無計可施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若你尋找秩序，那我無處不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，讓我們離開這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狀況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝洛內的人撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她殺不了我，我也殺不了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該回去準備一下了，貝洛內不會善罷甘休的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你贏了，萊昂圖索。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"籠絡瓦拉赫，並不是首領的打算，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在那個場合下，這才是最好的選擇，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不否認，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別說話了，我扶你去車上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你還是沒有放棄，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這點挫折，和拉維妮婭遇到的困難相比，又算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是做大事的人，萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一天，或許你真的能在敘拉古實現你的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，你要來做我的幫手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟拉維妮婭可合不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情適合她來做，但有些事情，適合你來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你小子，已經在盤算這樣的事情了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......德米特，我依然憤怒於你和父親的謀劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是不明白為什麼父親堅持要在現在動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我終究是這個家族的一分子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全著陸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......還是自己的據點舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，敘拉古的人還真是纏人，累死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，你還好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就是禮服稍微破了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，這件衣服我記得蠻貴的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，總會有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，一人一瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，別擺出那副表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就當做我們三個只是湊巧也在這座城市旅行而已吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是，演員是怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那個的話，只是順便拓展一下業務而已啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我想這樣說不定能比較方便找到你嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從結果上來說，確實也達成了目的就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"空氣稍微凝滯了一會。\n一個無法回避的問題在此時浮現。\n接下來怎麼辦？\n德克薩斯無法問出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，我和總監有過約定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我找到了你，我也會繼續在這裡完成我的演員合約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和總監有過一些交流，雖然現在回想起來有些後怕，但我相信，他不是那種會以我們的安危來威脅你的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實欸，如果那個伯伯想這麼做的話，我們早就被抓起來了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，你別說了，越說我越覺得嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是來找你順便觀光的，如果不是現在情況很危險，我還想讓你帶我們到處走走呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，等事情結束後，一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總而言之，先讓我們慶祝，企鵝物流在敘拉古再聚首！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"四人一同","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有見過的號碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該沒有告訴過其他人，這裡的號碼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐，看來你平安無事，這樣我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道德克薩斯的事了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放寬心，空小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想必企鵝物流的幾位正沉浸在重逢的喜悅之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以我也不打算過多打擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我想你應當也有許多事情想要問我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，明天，我會在劇院等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
